      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1942985385765933174",
      "text": "[5:30PM] #IjuIshaga #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth flow of traffic is observed at the Fagba intersection, along Jonathan Coker Road down to Amala, and on the return journey to the rail line. Moving from Fagba towards Pen Cinema, traffic is generally good, although a slow movement is observed underneath the bridge due to traffic alternation. The return journey from Pen Cinema to the college traffic light is clear.\n\nHospital Road down to African Church and Idi Agbon are currently experiencing good traffic flow. Similarly, Haruna Road and Oyemekun Road leading to Yaya Abatan are presently in good condition. The Ajayi area is slightly congested but still moving, likely due to increased traffic from the Excellence Hotel roundabout.\n\nThe route from Ajayi towards Jungle is currently experiencing fast movement, while traffic inward to Fagba is slow around Olowosokedile, leading back to the Fagba intersection. Traffic flow from Fagba towards Ishaga Roundabout is good, but there is a slow movement of vehicles at Ishaga Roundabout heading inwards towards Toyin. \n\nCurrently, there are no reported impediments, and our officers are actively managing traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
