      "text": "[6:25PM] #Mile12 #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Iyana School to Kosofe down to Mile 12 is slow.\n\nAscending and descending Mile 12 bridge inward Owode Elede down to Idera is also slow.\n\nLeaving Idera inw Irawo down to Odo Ogun very good.\n\nReturn journey is relatively calm with no record of any Impediment.\n\nOfficers are on ground doing the needful.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
